OL,3,GNEWSAHepworth sculpture returns after
OL,4,Asite makeover
OL,5,
OL,6,FA scheme to make the gateway to a
OL,7,Ffamous seaside town "more attractive,
OL,8,Fsafe and welcoming" has been completed.
OL,10,FThe Malakoff in St Ives, Cornwall, has
OL,11,Fspectacular views over the town
OL,12,Fharbour, Porthminster Beach and St Ives
OL,13,FBay and is home to a famous Barbara
OL,14,FHepworth sculpture.
OL,16,FBut the site was deemed ready for a
OL,17,Fmakeover by St Ives Town Deal, as part
OL,18,Fof its Low Carbon Transport Strategy
OL,19,Fencouraging the use of public
OL,20,Ftransport.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
