OL,3,GNEWSAHepworth sculpture returns after
OL,4,Asite makeover
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe finished work includes a new bus
OL,7,Fshelter, granite paving and planters,
OL,8,Filluminated benches and bike stands.
OL,9,FThe scheme involved the temporary
OL,10,Frelocation of Hepworth's Epidauros II
OL,11,Fsculpture, along with the historic mill
OL,12,Fwheel but both are now back at the
OL,13,Fsite.
